<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Broken Hill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Broken Hill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Keith Docking in Melbourne started coverage of Broken Hill Proprietary Co Ltd with a buy rating, with a 12-month price target of $32-33.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/8 to 28-3/8 in U.S. trading.</p>
<p>-- &quot;One of the world's largest resources companies, BHP is a significant player in the world's mining, steel and energy industries. Earnings growth has been robust, with profits from minerals operations rising consistently over the past decade,&quot; the analyst said in a report.</p>
</text>
